OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWet at first with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain and strong
OL,7,Fwinds. Rain and wind gradually easing
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon, becoming mostly
OL,9,Fdry by the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,12,Funsettled during this period, with a
OL,13,Fmixture of rain or showers and drier
OL,14,Fintervals with sunny spells.
OL,15,FOccasionally windy. Temperatures near
OL,16,Fnormal.
